{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788204467793,"sessionID":"ses_fa6bfda21ffejsIdYbHxpf8aCL","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_aa7e4f3a656f4b558c6d7682","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"venv/bin/python -c \"\nfrom bsoccer.data_loader import load_all\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nmatches, players = load_all()\n\ndef table(source, season):\n    rows = [m for m in matches if m.source_file==source and m.season==season and m.competition=='Brasileirão Série A']\n    t = defaultdict(lambda: {'P':0,'W':0,'D':0,'L':0,'GF':0,'GA':0})\n    for m in rows:\n        for side, gf, ga in [('home', m.home_goal, m.away_goal), ('away', m.away_goal, m.home_goal)]:\n            team = m.home if side=='home' else m.away\n            t[team]['P'] += 1; t[team]['GF'] += gf; t[team]['GA'] += ga\n            if gf > ga: t[team]['W'] += 1\n            elif gf == ga: t[team]['D'] += 1\n            else: t[team]['L'] += 1\n    for team, s in t.items(): s['Pts'] = s['W']*3 + s['D']\n    return sorted(t.items(), key=lambda kv: (-kv[1]['Pts'], -(kv[1]['GF']-kv[1]['GA']), -kv[1]['GF']))\n\n# 2019 from Brasileirao_Matches\nrows = [m for m in matches if m.source_file=='Brasileirao_Matches.csv' and m.season==2019]\nprint('2019 matches in Brasileirao_Matches:', len(rows))\nfor i,(team,s) in enumerate(table('Brasileirao_Matches.csv', 2019)[:5],1): print(i, team, s)\nprint('...')\nfor i,(team,s) in enumerate(table('Brasileirao_Matches.csv', 2019)[-4:],17): print(i, team, s)\nprint()\nrows2 = [m for m in matches if m.source_file=='novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv' and m.season==2019]\nprint('2019 matches in novo:', len(rows2))\nprint(table('novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv', 2019)[0])\n# 2020 relegation check: 2020 in Brasileirao_Matches?\nprint('2020 matches:', len([m for m in matches if m.source_file=='Brasileirao_Matches.csv' and m.season==2020]))\n\""},"output":"2019 matches in Brasileirao_Matches: 380\n1 Flamengo {'P': 38, 'W': 28, 'D': 6, 'L': 4, 'GF': 86, 'GA': 37, 'Pts': 90}\n2 Palmeiras {'P': 38, 'W': 21, 'D': 11, 'L': 6, 'GF': 61, 'GA': 32, 'Pts': 74}\n3 Santos {'P': 38, 'W': 22, 'D': 8, 'L': 8, 'GF': 60, 'GA': 33, 'Pts': 74}\n4 Grêmio {'P': 38, 'W': 19, 'D': 8, 'L': 11, 'GF': 64, 'GA': 39, 'Pts': 65}\n5 Athletico Paranaense {'P': 38, 'W': 18, 'D': 10, 'L': 10, 'GF': 51, 'GA': 32, 'Pts': 64}\n...\n17 Cruzeiro {'P': 38, 'W': 7, 'D': 15, 'L': 16, 'GF': 27, 'GA': 46, 'Pts': 36}\n18 Chapecoense {'P': 38, 'W': 7, 'D': 11, 'L': 20, 'GF': 31, 'GA': 52, 'Pts': 32}\n19 CSA {'P': 38, 'W': 8, 'D': 8, 'L': 22, 'GF': 24, 'GA': 58, 'Pts': 32}\n20 Avaí {'P': 38, 'W': 3, 'D': 11, 'L': 24, 'GF': 18, 'GA': 62, 'Pts': 20}\n\n2019 matches in novo: 380\n('Flamengo', {'P': 38, 'W': 28, 'D': 6, 'L': 4, 'GF': 86, 'GA': 37, 'Pts': 90})\n2020 matches: 380\n","metadata":{"output":"2019 matches in Brasileirao_Matches: 380\n1 Flamengo {'P': 38, 'W': 28, 'D': 6, 'L': 4, 'GF': 86, 'GA': 37, 'Pts': 90}\n2 Palmeiras {'P': 38, 'W': 21, 'D': 11, 'L': 6, 'GF': 61, 'GA': 32, 'Pts': 74}\n3 Santos {'P': 38, 'W': 22, 'D': 8, 'L': 8, 'GF': 60, 'GA': 33, 'Pts': 74}\n4 Grêmio {'P': 38, 'W': 19, 'D': 8, 'L': 11, 'GF': 64, 'GA': 39, 'Pts': 65}\n5 Athletico Paranaense {'P': 38, 'W': 18, 'D': 10, 'L': 10, 'GF': 51, 'GA': 32, 'Pts': 64}\n...\n17 Cruzeiro {'P': 38, 'W': 7, 'D': 15, 'L': 16, 'GF': 27, 'GA': 46, 'Pts': 36}\n18 Chapecoense {'P': 38, 'W': 7, 'D': 11, 'L': 20, 'GF': 31, 'GA': 52, 'Pts': 32}\n19 CSA {'P': 38, 'W': 8, 'D': 8, 'L': 22, 'GF': 24, 'GA': 58, 'Pts': 32}\n20 Avaí {'P': 38, 'W': 3, 'D': 11, 'L': 24, 'GF': 18, 'GA': 62, 'Pts': 20}\n\n2019 matches in novo: 380\n('Flamengo', {'P': 38, 'W': 28, 'D': 6, 'L': 4, 'GF': 86, 'GA': 37, 'Pts': 90})\n2020 matches: 380\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"venv/bin/python -c \"\nfrom bsoccer.data_loader import load_all\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nmatches, players = load_all()\n\ndef table(source, season):\n    rows = [m for m in matches if m.source_file==source and m.season==season and m.competition=='Brasileirão Série A']\n    t = defaultdict(lambda: {'P':0,'W':0,'D':0,'L':0,'GF':0,'GA':0})\n    for m in rows:\n        for side, gf, ga in [('home', m.home_goal, m.away_goal), ('away', m.away_goal, m.home_goal)]:\n            team = m.home if side=='home' else m.away\n            t[team]['P'] += 1; t[team]['GF'] += gf; t[team]['GA'] += ga\n            if gf > ga: t[team]['W'] += 1\n            elif gf == ga: t[team]['D'] += 1\n            else: t[team]['L'] += 1\n    for team, s in t.items(): s['Pts'] = s['W']*3 + s['D']\n    return sorted(t.items(), key=lambda kv: (-kv[1]['Pts'], -(kv[1]['GF']-kv[1]['GA']), -kv[1]['GF']))\n\n# 2019 from Brasileirao_Matches\nrows = [m for m in matches if m.source_file=='Brasileirao_Matches.csv' and m.season==2019]\nprint('2019 matches in Brasileirao_Matches:', len(rows))\nfor i,(team,s) in enumerate(table('Brasileirao_Matches.csv', 2019)[:5],1): print(i, team, s)\nprint('...')\nfor i,(team,s) in enumerate(table('Brasileirao_Matches.csv', 2019)[-4:],17): print(i, team, s)\nprint()\nrows2 = [m for m in matches if m.source_file=='novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv' and m.season==2019]\nprint('2019 matches in novo:', len(rows2))\nprint(table('novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv', 2019)[0])\n# 2020 relegation check: 2020 in Brasileirao_Matches?\nprint('2020 matches:', len([m for m in matches if m.source_file=='Brasileirao_Matches.csv' and m.season==2020]))\n\"","time":{"start":1788204467773,"end":1788204467792}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Cup rounds are numeric (1-8). The final in the Copa do Brasil format: rounds vary by season (2012 had more rounds). \"Final\" = highest round per season. For \"Find all Copa do Brasil finals\" I can define: for each season, the max round = final (rounds are per-season: round 1..N). Let me verify: cup 2012 rounds go to 8? 2012 Copa do Brasil had rounds up to 8? Format: 64 teams → 6 rounds (1st/2nd stage, 32ths...) Actually 2012: 64 teams = 6 knockout rounds. Hmm max is 8. Some seasons may include preliminaries. Let me check round distribution per season to define \"final\" as max round within season. Quick check: season 2012 rounds present: 1..? Let me verify which seasons have which max round and whether two-legged finals appear twice (home+away) — yes, finals are two-legged, so \"final\" filter returns 2 matches per season.\n\nAlternative simpler approach for finals: filter matches where round == max(round) for that season. I'll implement stage/round filter to support special value 'final' meaning: within each season, keep matches whose round equals the season's max numeric round (cup), or stage == 'final' (Libertadores). Good.\n\nNow verify standings math with the 2019 season (spec says Flamengo 90 pts). Two sources have 2019 Série A: Brasileirao_Matches (4180 covers 2012-2023?) and novo (2003-2019). Compute standings from Brasileirao_Matches for 2019 and check champion.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0594ac323001yEOxSlqgFn5Vep","sessionID":"ses_fa6bfda21ffejsIdYbHxpf8aCL","messageID":"msg_0594a651f001dlUyY3LJ5G98ep"}}
